sensitivity_state: sensitive

Edge case 14: “Don't tell the Doctor Agent”
Result
Plain Text
consent_state: restricted
blocked_agent_ids: ['iza_doctor']
allow_agent_access: true for other specifically authorised agents
A memory can be available to IZA while blocked from one specialist agent.

Edge case 15: “Keep it out of work mode”
Result
Plain Text
consent_state: restricted
permitted_domains: ['personal']
The memory must not be included in work-agent prompts, workplace summaries or work-related exports.

Edge case 16: User changes their mind
First:
“Don't store this.”
Later:
“Actually, remember it.”
Result
Create an explicit consent-expansion event. Do not pretend the later permission existed during the earlier restricted period.

Edge case 17: Temporary consent
Person
“Remember this until the trip is over.”
Result
Plain Text
